    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Filled Up Bottle",
      "",
      "When a friend got married, his wife brought a large bottle and said to him: ..",
      "\"From now on, each time you make me cry, I will add one drop of water to this bottle.\"",
      "\"Once the bottle is filled up, I will leave you. Because if the bottle is full, my heart will certainly be dead.\"",
      "",
      "Three years passed, and a few days ago, my friend secretly added a bunch of water to the bottle.",
      "He was discovered by his wife, and received a beating."
    ]
